## Context

- swisnf-metabolic-convergence: Completed deep methodology review of all 5 phases + SLC7A11/ROCK addendum.
- Key finding: 104 convergent genes are ~40% inflated (expected 40 under null, 2.6x enrichment). 0 genes pass FDR<0.05 in both ARID1A & SMARCA4. Convergence 64% driven by Ovary (n_mut=8 SMARCA4).
- OXPHOS enrichment (34/104 genes, FDR=2.56e-13) is ROBUST to FP inflation. Lipoic acid metabolism secondary (FDR=0.0045). Both mitochondrial.
- IACS-010759 PRISM: SMARCA4-specific (d=-0.36, p=0.007), NOT pan-SWI/SNF (ARID1A d=-0.02). Needs cancer-type stratification.
- TCGA expression: FAILED criterion (4/104, 3.8%). Only lung tested; need UCEC/OV expansion.
- SLC7A11: NOT convergent (0 SL hits). ROCK1/2: SMARCA4-Ovary specific only. GSH: definitively non-convergent.
- Statins/HMGCR: FALSIFIED (zero PRISM signal, zero cross-validation).
- Created journal entries: #2684 (Phase 1-2), #2685 (Phase 3), #2689 (Phase 4-5), #2690 (SLC7A11/ROCK).
- Created tasks: research_director #1627 (evaluate findings), developer #1628 (TCGA UCEC/OV + PRISM stratification).
- Next: await RD decision on framing (pan-SWI/SNF convergence vs SMARCA4-specific OXPHOS). Await developer TCGA/PRISM expansion. If IACS-010759 survives lung-only stratification, strongest translational finding.
